<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia inflation f'cast conservative-Evans.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia inflation f'cast conservative-Evans.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasury chief Ted Evans said on Monday the official forecasts for inflation were conservative.</p>
<p>Asked why the Treasury failed to project lower than expected inflation, Evans told a parliamentary committee: &quot;... we were conservative in forecasting inflation. We didn't expect that it would come down quite as much.&quot;</p>
</text>
